<li class="">Data Management documentation: Updated info regarding Google Cloud and Azure Blobs on  page (<a href="https://github.com/CIROH-UA/ciroh_hub/pull/178" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#178</a>, <a href="https://github.com/CIROH-UA/ciroh_hub/pull/179" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#179</a>)</li>
